    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a sudden business failure and a mountain of debt, you've lost everything and return to your hometown to start from scratch. <br>You\u2019ll have to survive day by day, take on small jobs, build your skills, and reconnect with the community to find new opportunities. <br>But reality isn\u2019t kind. <br>Under pressure from debt collectors and limited resources, your choices will determine your future. <br>Can you rise again through hardship and reclaim your life?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Begin your journey of survival and redemption now.</strong></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317850/extras/9da19025c4f0ec54c314ce131f273cbe.poster.avif?t=1749495004\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317850/extras/9da19025c4f0ec54c314ce131f273cbe.webm?t=1749495004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317850/extras/9da19025c4f0ec54c314ce131f273cbe.mp4?t=1749495004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Survival &amp; Economic Management</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317850/extras/7a6d62730e87908bf11e2141ebdaf0e5.poster.avif?t=1749495004\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317850/extras/7a6d62730e87908bf11e2141ebdaf0e5.webm?t=1749495004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317850/extras/7a6d62730e87908bf11e2141ebdaf0e5.mp4?t=1749495004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with low-paying jobs to make ends meet. Manage your time and money carefully to climb toward a better life.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balancing living expenses and loan repayments becomes a constant challenge that demands strategy and sacrifice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stat Growth and Skill Progression</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317850/extras/1794523ee7ddd37215fd4aa49b985e80.poster.avif?t=1749495004\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317850/extras/1794523ee7ddd37215fd4aa49b985e80.webm?t=1749495004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317850/extras/1794523ee7ddd37215fd4aa49b985e80.mp4?t=1749495004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop attributes like Strength, Intelligence, Agility, and Perception to unlock new job opportunities and interactions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train through mini-games, hard work, or study \u2014 tailor your growth to your play style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NPC Interactions and Relationships</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317850/extras/dba3a4463a4b569f90c68269d69e67cd.poster.avif?t=1749495004\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317850/extras/dba3a4463a4b569f90c68269d69e67cd.webm?t=1749495004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317850/extras/dba3a4463a4b569f90c68269d69e67cd.mp4?t=1749495004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build meaningful relationships with the people of your hometown.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain rewards or help by deepening bonds, and discover each NPC\u2019s unique story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grounded Life Simulation Elements</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317850/extras/dfa1f1bea4a4f535705cc565fdb171d3.poster.avif?t=1749495004\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317850/extras/dfa1f1bea4a4f535705cc565fdb171d3.webm?t=1749495004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317850/extras/dfa1f1bea4a4f535705cc565fdb171d3.mp4?t=1749495004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage fatigue, health, and emotional well-being to maintain a balanced life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recover or enhance these stats through work, rest, or hobbies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Mini-Games</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317850/extras/4130841466128adc2e3cc48ff5050fe2.poster.avif?t=1749495004\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317850/extras/4130841466128adc2e3cc48ff5050fe2.webm?t=1749495004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317850/extras/4130841466128adc2e3cc48ff5050fe2.mp4?t=1749495004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in interactive mini-games during job tasks and events to earn bonuses and enjoy a more hands-on gameplay experience.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a sudden business failure and a mountain of debt, you've lost everything and return to your hometown to start from scratch. <br>You\u2019ll have to survive day by day, take on small jobs, build your skills, and reconnect with the community to find new opportunities. <br>But reality isn\u2019t kind. <br>Under pressure from debt collectors and limited resources, your choices will determine your future. <br>Can you rise again through hardship and reclaim your life?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Begin your journey of survival and redemption now.</strong></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317850/extras/9da19025c4f0ec54c314ce131f273cbe.poster.avif?t=1749495004\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317850/extras/9da19025c4f0ec54c314ce131f273cbe.webm?t=1749495004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317850/extras/9da19025c4f0ec54c314ce131f273cbe.mp4?t=1749495004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Survival &amp; Economic Management</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317850/extras/7a6d62730e87908bf11e2141ebdaf0e5.poster.avif?t=1749495004\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317850/extras/7a6d62730e87908bf11e2141ebdaf0e5.webm?t=1749495004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317850/extras/7a6d62730e87908bf11e2141ebdaf0e5.mp4?t=1749495004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p